#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter.xml:108
msgid "Installation of Clutter"
msgstr "Instalação do <quote>Clutter</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter.xml:120
msgid ""
"Install <application>Clutter</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Clutter</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter.xml:124
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr               \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc           \\\n"
"            --enable-egl-backend        \\\n"
"            --enable-evdev-input        \\\n"
"            --enable-wayland-backend    \\\n"
"            --enable-wayland-compositor &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc           \\\n"
"            --enable-egl-backend        \\\n"
"            --enable-evdev-input        \\\n"
"            --enable-wayland-backend    \\\n"
"            --enable-wayland-compositor &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter.xml:134
msgid ""
"The test suite is not recommended because some tests may hang forever. If "
"you want to test the results anyway, issue: <command>make -j1 -k check</"
"command>. You must be in an xterm or similar, because it launches some "
"windows. Two tests, <filename>actor-destroy 1 /actor/destruction</filename> "
"and <filename>actor-paint-opacity 1 /actor/opacity/text</filename>, are "
"known to fail."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste não é recomendada porque alguns testes possivelmente travem "
"para sempre. Se você quiser testar os resultados de qualquer maneira, emita: "
"<command>make -j1 -k check</command>. Você precisa estar em um xterm ou "
"similar, pois ele abre algumas janelas. Dois testes, <filename>actor-destroy "
"1 /actor/destruction</filename> e <filename>actor-paint-opacity 1 /actor/"
"opacity/text</filename>, são conhecidos por falharem."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter.xml:144
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</"
"systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter.xml:147
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter.xml:152
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter.xml:155
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-egl-backend</parameter>: This switch enables the "
"experimental EGL windowing backend."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-egl-backend</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a estrutura "
"experimental de retaguarda de janelas &quot;EGL&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter.xml:160
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-evdev-input</parameter>: This switch enables the "
"experimental Evdev input backend which is required for <application>GNOME</"
"application> Wayland support."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-evdev-input</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a estrutura "
"experimental de retaguarda de entrada &quot;Evdev&quot; que é exigida para o "
"suporte do &quot;Wayland&quot; do &quot;<application>GNOME</"
"application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter.xml:166
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-wayland-backend</parameter> and <parameter>--enable-"
"wayland-compositor</parameter>: These switches enable the experimental "
"<application>Wayland</application> API in <application>Clutter</application> "
"which is required for <application>GNOME</application> Wayland support."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-wayland-backend</parameter> e <parameter>--enable-"
"wayland-compositor</parameter>: Essas chaves habilitam a &quot;API&quot; "
"experimental do &quot;<application>Wayland</application>&quot; no &quot;"
"<application>Clutter</application>&quot; que é exigida para o suporte do "
"&quot;Wayland&quot; do &quot;<application>GNOME</application>&quot;."

